# Environment the release self-SBOM is generated from (publish-pypi.yml, sbom
# job; mirrored on pull requests by the package job in github-ci-cd.yml): the
# project's runtime closure plus the SBOM generator. The wheel is installed on
# top with --no-deps. cyclonedx-bom is an exact pin on purpose: bumping it is a
# visible, reviewable change, and a yank fails the release instead of silently
# moving to another version.
-r runtime.in
cyclonedx-bom==5.5.0
